WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.700
=Episode 9=

01:35.740 --> 01:36.380
Mr. Chu.

01:37.950 --> 01:39.820
Mr. Sun want to see
you in the reception hall.

01:42.950 --> 01:44.350
Attend to your duties, Mr. Chu.

01:47.740 --> 01:48.710
Rest well.

02:17.980 --> 02:18.620
Commander Xiao.

02:23.230 --> 02:23.820
Mr. Sun.

02:25.070 --> 02:27.310
Might I know why you're here?

02:28.510 --> 02:29.350
This courtyard

02:29.700 --> 02:30.700
is particularly elegant,

02:30.980 --> 02:31.860
so I took a stroll.

02:32.380 --> 02:33.350
But I lost my way.

02:34.690 --> 02:35.510
I'm sorry

02:35.540 --> 02:37.030
I haven't been a better host

02:37.100 --> 02:38.030
and shown you

02:38.030 --> 02:39.070
around the premises.

02:40.100 --> 02:41.350
Since the sunshine today

02:44.700 --> 02:45.350
is mild,

02:46.140 --> 02:48.380
shall we have tea in the pavilion?

02:49.860 --> 02:50.510
This way.

02:51.310 --> 02:52.100
Have some tea.

02:52.230 --> 02:53.030
Have some tea.

02:54.720 --> 02:55.390
Young Master.

02:55.820 --> 02:56.700
The account records

02:56.860 --> 02:58.100
are in Sun Ling's secret room.

02:58.660 --> 02:59.190
Earlier,

02:59.260 --> 03:00.700
I concealed myself and was waiting,

03:01.230 --> 03:01.860
but observed

03:01.910 --> 03:03.510
Xiao Jue stealthily entering the study.

03:13.700 --> 03:14.350
Young Master,

03:15.310 --> 03:15.950
could he also be

03:15.980 --> 03:16.980
after account records?

03:21.100 --> 03:21.980
He couldn't have found

03:22.540 --> 03:23.420
Sun Xiangfu's dealings

03:23.470 --> 03:24.579
with Master.

03:25.260 --> 03:27.200
He's likely
after Yezhou Garrison's tax ledgers.

03:27.660 --> 03:29.190
But if he obtains them first,

03:29.420 --> 03:30.310
we'll lose

03:30.350 --> 03:31.030
the initiative.

03:32.540 --> 03:33.100
Yingxiang,

03:34.050 --> 03:34.860
watch

03:34.860 --> 03:36.030
Xiao Jue's every move.

03:36.910 --> 03:37.510
Yes.

04:59.190 --> 05:00.870
Commander Xiao, have some tea.

05:04.070 --> 05:04.870
This smells like

05:05.310 --> 05:06.510
the Junshan Yinzhen tea.

05:07.510 --> 05:08.550
Excellent quality indeed.

05:09.630 --> 05:10.220
Mr. Sun,

05:11.260 --> 05:12.670
your generosity knows no bounds.

05:15.820 --> 05:16.820
A gift from my friend.

05:17.260 --> 05:17.900
Otherwise,

05:18.110 --> 05:19.510
with my meager official salary,

05:19.780 --> 05:21.510
I couldn't afford such fine tea.

05:25.220 --> 05:25.750
Knowing

05:25.750 --> 05:26.990
our men in Yezhou Garrison

05:28.140 --> 05:29.670
still lack military pay,

05:30.550 --> 05:32.380
I feel really uneasy

05:33.110 --> 05:36.340
drinking such fine tea.

05:39.110 --> 05:39.780
Commander Xiao,

05:40.380 --> 05:41.750
your words ring true.

05:42.510 --> 05:43.900
Military life is arduous.

05:44.460 --> 05:46.510
I share their hardships in spirit.

05:47.670 --> 05:50.340
But Yezhou suffers yearly calamities

05:50.820 --> 05:51.870
and poor harvests,

05:52.380 --> 05:54.310
making provisions and pay impossible.

05:55.190 --> 05:55.750
Previously,

05:55.820 --> 05:57.750
border trade supplemented our funds,

05:58.020 --> 05:58.700
but now,

05:58.700 --> 06:00.110
constant clashes with Wutuo

06:00.220 --> 06:01.430
have halted all commerce.

06:02.070 --> 06:02.780
Thus

06:03.190 --> 06:04.070
revenues vanished.

06:04.340 --> 06:05.020
No income means

06:05.070 --> 06:06.190
people can't pay taxes.

06:06.260 --> 06:06.990
Without taxes,

06:07.380 --> 06:09.990
how can I procure military funds?

06:14.070 --> 06:15.580
Forgive my frankness,

06:16.780 --> 06:19.430
as Yezhou's magistrate,

06:19.820 --> 06:21.220
when I think of soldiers

06:21.340 --> 06:22.460
enduring hunger,

06:23.900 --> 06:25.630
my heart aches.

06:26.630 --> 06:27.380
If selling myself

06:27.670 --> 06:29.460
could raise funds,

06:29.870 --> 06:31.260
I'd gladly trade myself

06:31.340 --> 06:32.140
for military funds

06:32.510 --> 06:33.780
to support our troops.

06:39.190 --> 06:41.380
Your words

06:41.780 --> 06:43.260
are truly moving.

06:47.870 --> 06:48.990
Were it not for our garrison

06:49.070 --> 06:50.630
going unpaid for a long time,

06:51.220 --> 06:52.990
I might believe what you said.

06:56.110 --> 06:56.750
Master.

06:57.750 --> 06:59.110
Mr. Chu has arrived at the hall.

07:00.990 --> 07:02.110
Mr. Chu has arrived?

07:02.220 --> 07:02.850
Yes.

07:03.140 --> 07:04.510
Commander, should we...?

07:04.750 --> 07:05.430
Perhaps...

07:06.220 --> 07:06.780
Okay.

07:07.070 --> 07:08.220
I understand your meaning.

07:08.430 --> 07:09.870
Do as you please.

07:09.990 --> 07:11.220
I'll return shortly.

07:43.110 --> 07:44.630
Why does it hurt so much?

07:57.070 --> 07:58.630
(This thing must be poisonous.)

08:14.020 --> 08:14.990
(He hasn't gone far)

08:15.460 --> 08:17.110
(and is still secretly watching me.)

08:18.580 --> 08:19.260
(This poison...)

08:19.900 --> 08:21.310
(He doesn't just want to kill me.)

08:22.220 --> 08:23.190
(And Xiao Jue, too.)

08:35.700 --> 08:36.270
What's up?

08:36.390 --> 08:36.980
Let go.

08:37.340 --> 08:38.950
Someone placed a poisonous ball on me.

09:08.220 --> 09:09.270
Another wasted effort.

09:10.070 --> 09:11.100
Another wasted effort.

09:11.790 --> 09:12.580
He...

09:17.390 --> 09:19.500
- What are you doing?
- Nothing.

09:19.820 --> 09:20.790
What are you doing?

09:21.700 --> 09:22.390
Why not smile?

09:23.270 --> 09:23.980
Why smile?

09:24.430 --> 09:25.150
How can you smile?

09:25.380 --> 09:25.980
Not smiling.

09:25.980 --> 09:27.100
Not smiling? Why not?

09:27.740 --> 09:28.430
Why smile?

09:28.670 --> 09:29.220
Get lost.

09:29.390 --> 09:29.980
Get lost.

09:37.740 --> 09:38.820
They fell into the water.

09:39.620 --> 09:40.270
They'll wash up

09:40.430 --> 09:41.550
thoroughly.

09:41.820 --> 09:43.150
That scented ball became useless.

09:44.150 --> 09:46.310
Falling into the water
right after we replaced

09:46.670 --> 09:47.670
his scented ball.

09:48.620 --> 09:50.270
This is too much of a coincidence.

09:53.430 --> 09:55.190
He must be faking blindness.

09:56.340 --> 09:57.100
That young man

09:57.190 --> 09:58.740
is truly unnatural.

10:00.950 --> 10:02.070
Slippery as a loach,

10:03.310 --> 10:04.550
he's impossible to grasp.

10:24.860 --> 10:25.700
My belt!

10:26.820 --> 10:28.460
Belt! Where's my belt?

10:29.430 --> 10:30.460
Where's my belt?

10:30.740 --> 10:31.430
Belt.

10:32.820 --> 10:33.550
Uncle!

10:33.860 --> 10:35.430
I can't find my belt.

10:35.620 --> 10:37.070
Could you fetch it for me?

10:40.160 --> 10:40.740
Here.

11:12.220 --> 11:13.310
You're so good to me.

11:15.860 --> 11:17.190
You called me uncle, after all.

11:18.950 --> 11:19.580
Uncle,

11:20.910 --> 11:21.980
what about my allowance?

11:22.700 --> 11:23.340
Where is it?

11:37.950 --> 11:39.550
It's not worth being your nephew.

11:41.100 --> 11:42.070
You're unlucky to have

11:42.340 --> 11:43.310
a heartless uncle.

11:44.070 --> 11:44.860
Who said that?

11:45.220 --> 11:46.430
You're clearly warm-hearted

11:46.620 --> 11:47.270
and magnanimous.

11:47.580 --> 11:48.500
General Fengyun,

11:49.430 --> 11:50.030
as good

11:50.220 --> 11:51.430
as your reputation.

11:56.030 --> 11:56.740
Earlier,

11:57.390 --> 11:59.100
you really went all out.

12:00.340 --> 12:02.550
I couldn't let you get involved.

12:03.310 --> 12:03.980
Fortunately,

12:04.310 --> 12:04.980
that scented ball

12:05.190 --> 12:06.070
is now useless.

12:08.700 --> 12:09.860
There were many methods,

12:10.500 --> 12:12.100
but you chose the most foolish one.

12:13.950 --> 12:15.820
It indeed required suffering,

12:16.340 --> 12:16.860
but

12:17.190 --> 12:19.030
it was also undoubtedly the fastest way.

12:25.820 --> 12:26.430
Cold?

12:37.150 --> 12:38.220
Put on your clothes.

12:39.220 --> 12:40.220
If you catch a cold,

12:41.150 --> 12:41.910
I won't care.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.550
Ding Yi

13:00.310 --> 13:02.030
is clearly targeting Xiao Jue.

13:03.220 --> 13:04.580
I'll investigate this thoroughly.

13:49.270 --> 13:51.100
You want to kill Cheng Lisu,

13:52.070 --> 13:52.910
but General Feihong

13:52.910 --> 13:54.070
clearly ordered you to take

13:54.150 --> 13:55.340
Xiao Jue's life.

13:56.310 --> 13:58.220
He keeps sabotaging things.

13:58.700 --> 13:59.700
Killing him

14:00.700 --> 14:01.460
would eliminate

14:01.460 --> 14:02.860
Xiao Jue's right-hand man.

14:03.980 --> 14:04.740
Then

14:05.390 --> 14:07.340
matters would become much simpler.

14:12.070 --> 14:14.740
This isn't a bad approach.

14:16.860 --> 14:19.070
I just worry that Xiao Jue...

14:24.500 --> 14:25.700
(It was indeed He Rufei.)

14:26.860 --> 14:29.150
(But why would He Rufei
want to kill Xiao Jue?)

14:50.070 --> 14:50.620
Guards!

14:50.910 --> 14:51.580
Assassin!

14:53.150 --> 14:53.910
Assassin! Hurry!

14:55.230 --> 14:55.740
Over here!

14:56.320 --> 14:56.860
Hurry!

15:23.330 --> 15:23.900
Hurry!

15:25.090 --> 15:25.660
Over here.

15:26.180 --> 15:26.940
Hurry.

15:46.460 --> 15:47.070
Go on.

15:50.660 --> 15:51.200
This way.

15:51.810 --> 15:52.450
Hurry.

15:53.550 --> 15:55.070
(Hide in the Commander's room.)

16:15.670 --> 16:17.100
(Why is he bathing at this moment?)

16:22.910 --> 16:24.500
Did I enter the wrong room?

16:27.680 --> 16:28.290
This...

16:33.100 --> 16:33.860
Where am I?

16:33.860 --> 16:36.460
Take off your stealth outfit
before playing these tricks.

16:47.340 --> 16:49.500
Commander Xiao? Are you sleeping?

17:08.300 --> 17:09.630
Trespassing into my room.

17:10.460 --> 17:11.300
Is this

17:12.150 --> 17:13.630
how you treat your guests?

17:14.190 --> 17:16.109
Sorry, Commander Xiao. A thief entered.

17:16.430 --> 17:19.390
I feared it would disturb you,
so I came to investigate.

17:20.500 --> 17:21.460
You should thoroughly

17:21.460 --> 17:22.430
check every inch

17:23.190 --> 17:25.150
of this room.

17:25.780 --> 17:27.109
You are skilled in martial arts.

17:27.260 --> 17:28.630
Why would you fear a thief?

17:29.910 --> 17:30.780
But

17:31.300 --> 17:33.110
Mr. Cheng lacks skills in martial arts.

17:33.460 --> 17:34.670
When I visited his room,

17:35.430 --> 17:36.460
he wasn't present.

17:40.190 --> 17:40.830
My nephew

17:41.670 --> 17:42.390
has a fondness

17:42.390 --> 17:44.150
for the pastries
from Shiyunju in Yezhou,

17:44.780 --> 17:46.220
so my man took him there.

17:47.430 --> 17:48.100
Is there

17:49.980 --> 17:50.980
a problem with that?

17:52.870 --> 17:53.670
My apologies.

18:18.540 --> 18:19.260
Thank you.

18:21.120 --> 18:21.740
It's lucky

18:21.740 --> 18:22.950
that you bathe daily.

18:23.430 --> 18:24.150
The servants

18:24.150 --> 18:25.220
deliver water every day.

18:27.430 --> 18:28.700
Why was Ding Yi after you?

18:30.350 --> 18:31.430
Why were you wearing

18:31.950 --> 18:33.150
a stealth outfit?

18:40.590 --> 18:41.780
That black-clad figure earlier

18:42.780 --> 18:43.910
was you, right?

18:46.430 --> 18:47.390
Why ask questions

18:47.870 --> 18:49.150
you know the answers to?

18:52.630 --> 18:53.740
Why pretend to be blind?

18:56.830 --> 18:57.540
Not pretending.

18:58.110 --> 18:58.780
It's just

18:59.260 --> 19:00.220
that I'm blessed,

19:00.670 --> 19:01.540
so I can recover

19:01.540 --> 19:03.540
slightly faster than others.

19:04.950 --> 19:06.060
Significantly faster.

19:08.830 --> 19:10.110
But I was

19:10.430 --> 19:11.260
truly blind

19:11.300 --> 19:12.460
for your sake.

19:12.700 --> 19:13.950
Don't be ungrateful.

19:16.500 --> 19:17.150
He Yan.

19:22.220 --> 19:22.870
Get out.

19:40.980 --> 19:42.350
(Why would He Rufei send someone)

19:42.350 --> 19:43.700
(to assassinate Xiao Jue?)

19:44.630 --> 19:45.910
(What is he truly after?)

19:47.350 --> 19:47.950
(No.)

19:48.740 --> 19:49.700
(I can't just wait.)

20:03.870 --> 20:05.780
You want to kill Cheng Lisu,

20:06.670 --> 20:07.630
but General Feihong

20:07.630 --> 20:08.700
clearly ordered you to take

20:08.740 --> 20:10.060
Xiao Jue's life.

20:10.460 --> 20:12.500
He keeps sabotaging things.

20:13.670 --> 20:14.700
Killing him

20:15.300 --> 20:16.020
would cut off

20:16.060 --> 20:17.540
Xiao Jue's right-hand man.

20:18.190 --> 20:18.910
Then

20:20.020 --> 20:22.150
matters would become much simpler.

20:22.830 --> 20:24.220
(Sun Xiangfu's servant)

20:24.870 --> 20:26.300
(is actually He Rufei's man?)

20:27.430 --> 20:28.780
(The delay in rescue at Mingshui,)

20:29.670 --> 20:31.060
(the political betrayal in court,)

20:31.630 --> 20:33.060
(and the assassination in Yezhou.)

20:34.630 --> 20:35.540
(He Rufei,)

20:36.350 --> 20:37.670
(in my memory,)

20:38.220 --> 20:40.060
(you weren't this treacherous.)

20:41.150 --> 20:43.060
(What corrupted you so?)

20:45.060 --> 20:47.020
(Or did I misjudge you from the start?)

20:47.430 --> 20:49.110
(Was this your true nature?)

20:50.110 --> 20:50.950
(Besides,)

20:55.700 --> 20:57.060
(what role)

20:58.190 --> 21:00.150
(does she play in this?)

21:19.430 --> 21:20.110
Young Master,

21:20.260 --> 21:21.260
someone was eavesdropping

21:21.260 --> 21:22.740
on Sun Xiangfu and Ding Yi's talk.

21:23.350 --> 21:24.260
Ding Yi chased him

21:24.350 --> 21:25.300
to Xiao Jue's room.

21:25.980 --> 21:28.110
Xiao Jue happened
to be bathing at the time.

21:29.020 --> 21:29.670
Perfect timing.

21:30.500 --> 21:31.430
Yeah, perfect timing.

21:31.830 --> 21:33.870
Xiao Jue must already know by now

21:34.060 --> 21:34.980
He Rufei sent Ding Yi

21:34.980 --> 21:35.870
to kill him.

21:36.060 --> 21:37.020
Let him know.

21:37.670 --> 21:38.590
After all, He Rufei

21:38.870 --> 21:39.780
is the one who did it.

21:43.460 --> 21:44.110
Young Master,

21:44.460 --> 21:45.630
you've been reading so long.

21:46.190 --> 21:46.950
Have a rest

21:47.110 --> 21:47.870
and have some soup.

21:48.500 --> 21:50.500
This goji and fish soup is
good for the eyes.

21:50.950 --> 21:51.460
Alright.

22:13.260 --> 22:13.780
Who's there?

22:30.910 --> 22:32.190
Trying to act mysterious?

22:32.830 --> 22:34.460
Today, I'll send you to the grave.

22:34.780 --> 22:36.390
Let me be the one to send you off.

22:37.020 --> 22:37.780
In your next life,

22:38.350 --> 22:40.500
don't collude with wicked people again.

22:41.020 --> 22:42.870
(That voice belongs to Cheng Lisu.)

22:48.300 --> 22:48.910
What?

22:49.350 --> 22:50.260
Can't you recognize me?

22:50.980 --> 22:52.060
Who exactly are you?

22:57.700 --> 22:58.950
You're not Cheng Lisu.

22:59.740 --> 23:00.950
He has no martial skills.

23:01.260 --> 23:02.110
Who do you think

23:02.500 --> 23:03.350
I am?

23:04.540 --> 23:05.670
No matter who you are,

23:05.950 --> 23:07.430
today, you'll be killed.

23:43.220 --> 23:44.500
You've really chosen

23:44.500 --> 23:46.700
a fine burial spot for yourself.

23:48.260 --> 23:49.700
This place is used by the Sun family

23:49.910 --> 23:51.700
to suppress vengeful souls.

23:52.300 --> 23:53.260
Each Buddha statue

23:53.590 --> 23:54.830
represents a vengeful soul.

23:55.390 --> 23:56.260
Soon,

23:56.870 --> 23:58.950
you'll become one of them,

23:59.780 --> 24:01.390
being trapped for eternity.

24:02.430 --> 24:03.870
I'm a vengeful ghost crawling out

24:03.910 --> 24:05.020
from the Netherworld.

24:05.700 --> 24:07.020
I care nothing for reincarnation.

24:07.430 --> 24:08.220
Besides,

24:08.500 --> 24:09.740
if I can come and go freely,

24:10.190 --> 24:11.590
these paper charms and clay statues

24:11.910 --> 24:13.460
are just worthless objects.

24:14.350 --> 24:15.300
They mean nothing.

26:19.300 --> 26:19.910
Don't close it.

26:21.590 --> 26:22.980
Let me watch

26:23.500 --> 26:24.740
how this storm

26:24.830 --> 26:25.870
will wash over the world.

26:29.500 --> 26:30.460
Let's make Sun Mansion

26:30.700 --> 26:31.590
descend into chaos.

26:32.220 --> 26:33.980
The more chaos, the better for you.

26:34.870 --> 26:35.780
I wonder what role

26:36.390 --> 26:37.830
Mr. He will play

26:38.590 --> 26:39.590
in this game.

26:50.780 --> 26:51.910
Does your master He Rufei

26:53.190 --> 26:54.870
know about your incompetence?

26:58.150 --> 26:58.780
Ding Yi.

26:59.830 --> 27:01.190
I won't fall for

27:01.300 --> 27:02.220
the same person twice.

27:02.980 --> 27:03.870
Today,

27:04.980 --> 27:06.670
it's my turn to send you to the grave.

27:08.020 --> 27:09.540
Let's see if you can earn rebirth.

27:11.350 --> 27:12.460
Who exactly are you?

27:18.590 --> 27:19.590
You once killed

27:20.300 --> 27:21.740
a blind woman.

27:23.590 --> 27:25.110
Who do you think I am?

27:26.300 --> 27:27.540
He Yan.

27:30.150 --> 27:30.980
But

27:31.350 --> 27:32.700
if you tell me

27:33.590 --> 27:35.430
why He Rufei wants Xiao Jue dead,

27:36.740 --> 27:38.390
I'll make your death quick.

27:40.150 --> 27:41.630
Do you care about Xiao Jue that much?

27:43.390 --> 27:44.260
We are companions

27:45.060 --> 27:46.780
who've survived
life-and-death situations.

27:47.220 --> 27:48.150
Of course I care.

27:50.740 --> 27:51.870
Even if I die,

27:52.830 --> 27:54.020
I'll never betray

27:54.110 --> 27:54.870
my general.

27:58.950 --> 28:00.590
Since you won't talk,

28:01.190 --> 28:02.700
go tell the God of Death.

28:07.540 --> 28:09.700
I'm a ghost of the one you murdered.

28:10.670 --> 28:12.460
I clawed my way out of the Netherworld,

28:13.830 --> 28:15.670
and came here to claim your life.

28:28.060 --> 28:29.190
Who exactly are you?

28:37.020 --> 28:37.590
Commander.

28:38.060 --> 28:39.300
What do you mean by that?

28:39.630 --> 28:41.590
I have pretended
to be Cheng Lisu for a few days.

28:41.740 --> 28:42.670
Don't you recognize me?

28:43.110 --> 28:44.060
I'm He Yan.

28:48.190 --> 28:49.190
What did you mean

28:50.260 --> 28:51.700
by "I'm a ghost of the one

28:53.020 --> 28:53.980
you murdered"?

28:56.020 --> 28:58.390
I was just trying to scare Ding Yi.

29:01.150 --> 29:02.500
Still refusing to tell the truth?

29:03.670 --> 29:04.670
Miss He.

29:08.870 --> 29:09.830
You're clearly a woman,

29:10.910 --> 29:12.500
yet registered under a male identity

29:13.390 --> 29:14.630
to join Yezhou Garrison.

29:16.020 --> 29:17.190
May I ask you

29:17.780 --> 29:18.950
what your intentions are?

29:20.060 --> 29:20.780
Commander.

29:21.300 --> 29:22.430
When did you find out?

29:25.350 --> 29:25.950
I thought

29:26.020 --> 29:27.830
you were a spy sent by He Rufei.

29:29.910 --> 29:31.540
But you just killed his man.

29:35.590 --> 29:37.110
So why exactly

29:38.190 --> 29:40.630
did you hide your identity
to join Yezhou Garrison?

29:42.060 --> 29:43.060
If you tell the truth,

29:43.540 --> 29:45.540
I'll consider letting you
join the battalion.

29:46.220 --> 29:47.260
(A trap?)

29:47.630 --> 29:48.500
(I don't buy it.)

29:50.910 --> 29:51.430
Commander.

29:51.830 --> 29:52.670
Are you serious?

29:56.190 --> 29:57.110
My registration

29:57.300 --> 29:58.700
is true.

29:59.220 --> 30:00.110
But when my mother

30:00.910 --> 30:02.220
was pregnant with me,

30:02.670 --> 30:03.950
she met a wise seer.

30:04.950 --> 30:05.950
The seer said

30:06.260 --> 30:07.980
if she bore a son,

30:08.700 --> 30:10.060
he'd be a military prodigy.

30:10.540 --> 30:11.460
But if it were a girl,

30:12.430 --> 30:13.630
she would die early.

30:14.430 --> 30:15.700
That's why since birth,

30:16.590 --> 30:18.020
I've been raised as a boy.

30:18.390 --> 30:19.260
So the registry

30:19.870 --> 30:21.020
listed me as male.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.220
By that logic,

30:24.060 --> 30:24.870
the Fuyue Army moves

30:24.870 --> 30:26.870
you demonstrated while taming horses

30:27.870 --> 30:28.910
were also taught to you

30:29.150 --> 30:30.350
by this seer in your dreams?

30:32.300 --> 30:33.430
Not exactly.

30:34.220 --> 30:35.740
Living as a boy,

30:36.260 --> 30:37.020
I naturally aspired

30:37.390 --> 30:38.460
to become a general

30:38.780 --> 30:39.670
and make my mark.

30:40.150 --> 30:41.150
Just like you, Commander.

30:44.670 --> 30:46.150
After joining the Fuyue Army,

30:46.740 --> 30:48.540
I achieved some success.

30:49.350 --> 30:50.020
Unfortunately,

30:50.460 --> 30:52.150
my squad leader discovered my identity.

30:52.540 --> 30:54.020
Luckily, he was kind

30:54.500 --> 30:55.780
and didn't expose me.

30:56.500 --> 30:57.060
But

30:57.300 --> 30:58.260
he feared implication,

30:58.300 --> 30:59.630
so he made me

31:00.020 --> 31:01.950
claim injury to retire

31:02.110 --> 31:03.020
and return home.

31:07.640 --> 31:12.700
(Exsoldier in the Fuyue Army, He Yan
retired after injuries half a year ago.)

31:12.700 --> 31:14.150
(Thankfully, Master forged)

31:14.220 --> 31:15.220
(my registry thoroughly.)

31:18.500 --> 31:19.110
Commander.

31:19.220 --> 31:19.780
Well,

31:19.980 --> 31:21.020
I've answered all.

31:21.260 --> 31:21.950
Don't you think

31:22.260 --> 31:23.300
I'm now qualified

31:23.350 --> 31:24.220
to join the battalion?

31:24.460 --> 31:26.020
If your identity was exposed before,

31:26.590 --> 31:27.910
why enlist again?

31:28.460 --> 31:29.700
What if the past repeats?

31:31.350 --> 31:32.670
I want to be a general

31:33.740 --> 31:35.150
and protect my country.

31:35.870 --> 31:36.910
Moreover, I trust

31:36.980 --> 31:37.740
the Xiao Army

31:38.590 --> 31:39.870
won't dwell on trivialities,

31:40.670 --> 31:41.740
but value true talent

31:42.870 --> 31:44.150
and give me a fair chance.

32:02.220 --> 32:02.830
Keep up.

32:03.910 --> 32:05.190
The corpse...

32:05.910 --> 32:06.740
Let Feinu handle it.

32:09.150 --> 32:09.700
Commander.

32:10.390 --> 32:11.300
Why walk so fast?

32:12.150 --> 32:13.350
Waiting to get caught?

32:31.950 --> 32:32.540
Commander.

32:33.500 --> 32:34.500
Help me apply medicine.

32:34.870 --> 32:35.590
I can't reach it.

32:37.700 --> 32:38.540
You're playing a man,

32:39.390 --> 32:40.670
but not a real man.

32:42.260 --> 32:43.390
You're a noble man,

32:43.950 --> 32:45.300
so I trust you completely.

33:10.140 --> 33:10.670
Commander.

33:11.060 --> 33:12.150
Could you be gentler?

33:12.390 --> 33:13.980
I'm made of flesh and blood.

33:16.190 --> 33:17.190
Now you feel pain?

33:17.630 --> 33:18.910
Weren't you tough earlier?

33:20.540 --> 33:22.260
Different circumstances.

33:22.630 --> 33:23.910
On the battlefield,

33:24.190 --> 33:25.220
as a soldier,

33:25.390 --> 33:26.540
even with my last breath,

33:26.910 --> 33:28.060
I'd fight to the end.

33:28.780 --> 33:29.780
Now, during peace,

33:29.910 --> 33:32.460
I should properly recuperate.

33:33.630 --> 33:34.980
Your reading paid off.

33:36.430 --> 33:37.630
Though I'm a woman,

33:38.350 --> 33:39.910
my military tactics and martial skills

33:40.020 --> 33:40.950
rival any man's.

33:41.350 --> 33:42.190
I believe

33:42.500 --> 33:43.780
you've witnessed it firsthand.

33:49.110 --> 33:49.830
Why did you

33:50.910 --> 33:51.910
fight with

33:51.950 --> 33:52.540
He Rufei's man?

33:58.100 --> 34:00.020
It was all for you, Commander.

34:02.580 --> 34:03.270
For me?

34:04.750 --> 34:05.390
Exactly.

34:05.750 --> 34:07.140
I overheard someone plotting

34:07.430 --> 34:08.350
to kill you.

34:08.710 --> 34:09.830
As your subordinate,

34:10.139 --> 34:10.909
it's my duty

34:11.060 --> 34:12.389
to eliminate all threats to you.

34:13.020 --> 34:13.710
So I decided

34:13.790 --> 34:14.870
to investigate covertly.

34:15.139 --> 34:16.659
But someone spotted me.

34:17.100 --> 34:18.909
He tried to silence me.

34:19.310 --> 34:20.270
Every strike was lethal.

34:20.580 --> 34:21.750
I couldn't hold back.

34:22.270 --> 34:22.949
After all,

34:23.310 --> 34:24.750
I need to keep myself alive

34:24.870 --> 34:26.020
to serve you.

34:37.179 --> 34:38.100
Commander,

34:39.870 --> 34:40.830
do you still not believe

34:40.870 --> 34:41.710
what I'm saying?

34:42.429 --> 34:43.460
My loyalty to you

34:43.790 --> 34:44.949
is truer than gold.

34:45.540 --> 34:47.020
Every word comes from my heart.

34:47.580 --> 34:48.100
I swear it.

34:51.139 --> 34:52.540
Stay still. I'm not done.

35:03.950 --> 35:04.500
Commander,

35:05.710 --> 35:07.350
can I join the battalion now?

35:12.350 --> 35:13.230
Why are you

35:14.540 --> 35:15.830
so fixated on

35:17.350 --> 35:18.540
joining the battalion?

35:32.910 --> 35:33.500
Obviously,

35:33.950 --> 35:34.980
it's because I admire you.

35:35.980 --> 35:37.060
I want to achieve greatness

35:37.790 --> 35:38.620
under your command.

35:39.430 --> 35:39.950
Commander,

35:40.660 --> 35:41.950
everyone in your battalion

35:42.270 --> 35:42.980
earned their place

35:43.020 --> 35:44.020
through genuine skills.

35:44.830 --> 35:46.230
You value merit above all.

35:46.910 --> 35:47.580
That's why

35:48.390 --> 35:49.910
I sought to join your ranks,

35:50.660 --> 35:51.390
to prove

35:51.870 --> 35:52.910
no matter one's status

35:53.390 --> 35:54.270
or gender,

35:54.870 --> 35:56.100
anyone can achieve greatness

35:56.580 --> 35:57.460
and serve the nation.

35:58.540 --> 35:59.230
Where there is

35:59.910 --> 36:00.660
a will,

36:01.350 --> 36:02.180
there's a way.

36:02.790 --> 36:03.620
Someday,

36:04.540 --> 36:05.950
I'll become a renowned general.

36:09.310 --> 36:10.140
Your speech

36:10.710 --> 36:11.830
was flawless

36:12.350 --> 36:13.390
and quite convincing.

36:14.460 --> 36:15.200
But

36:16.460 --> 36:17.710
do you think I'll believe that?

36:18.430 --> 36:19.540
If you don't tell the truth,

36:20.270 --> 36:21.460
then leave Yezhou Garrison.

36:22.020 --> 36:23.140
You can't go back

36:23.310 --> 36:24.310
on your word!

36:26.460 --> 36:27.540
If you're not honest,

36:27.980 --> 36:29.710
don't demand honesty from others.

36:30.910 --> 36:32.100
If you expel me,

36:32.140 --> 36:33.020
you'll regret it.

36:33.950 --> 36:34.710
Regret?

36:35.710 --> 36:36.430
I admit

36:36.580 --> 36:37.390
you have talent,

36:37.870 --> 36:39.140
but the Nine Banners Battalion

36:39.950 --> 36:41.270
is full of talented people.

36:42.950 --> 36:44.020
I can't even stay

36:44.350 --> 36:45.620
in Yezhou Garrison much longer.

36:46.390 --> 36:46.980
In short,

36:47.980 --> 36:49.060
if you drive me away,

36:50.430 --> 36:51.180
I'll spread rumors

36:51.580 --> 36:52.710
that you have a sweetheart.

36:54.750 --> 36:55.460
After all,

36:55.830 --> 36:57.180
everyone knows you avoid

36:57.580 --> 36:58.500
romantic entanglements.

37:03.750 --> 37:06.020
Go ahead. Who'd believe such nonsense?

37:06.390 --> 37:07.350
Words aren't convincing,

37:07.980 --> 37:09.060
but I have evidence.

37:10.230 --> 37:10.830
Commander,

37:11.270 --> 37:12.430
I happen to know

37:13.100 --> 37:14.500
you have a red mole

37:15.460 --> 37:16.460
an inch above your waist.

37:17.540 --> 37:18.620
Only an intimate partner

37:19.350 --> 37:20.660
would know

37:20.910 --> 37:22.140
such private details.

37:30.540 --> 37:31.580
Nonsense.

37:32.310 --> 37:33.350
It's not nonsense.

37:35.580 --> 37:36.430
Commander,

37:36.750 --> 37:37.980
your looks are exceptional,

37:38.390 --> 37:40.060
and even that charming mole

37:40.310 --> 37:42.180
is perfectly placed

37:42.500 --> 37:43.750
and cute.

37:44.540 --> 37:45.460
It makes people

37:45.870 --> 37:47.060
hard to forget.

37:48.350 --> 37:49.230
- You...
- Commander.

37:49.830 --> 37:50.660
There's something.

37:52.310 --> 37:53.020
Mr. Feinu,

37:53.180 --> 37:54.100
come in.

37:57.340 --> 37:57.910
What is it?

37:58.100 --> 37:59.140
This is my room.

38:13.710 --> 38:15.910
What is it you want to tell me?

38:17.750 --> 38:18.270
Commander.

38:18.910 --> 38:20.060
As you instructed,

38:20.390 --> 38:21.750
I buried the body in the shrine

38:22.020 --> 38:22.750
and left clues

38:23.060 --> 38:24.270
to see Sun Xiangfu's reaction.

38:25.100 --> 38:26.500
But while burying the body,

38:27.180 --> 38:28.790
I discovered something there.

38:33.870 --> 38:34.460
Commander.

38:34.870 --> 38:36.060
Perhaps you should go see it.

39:01.430 --> 39:02.020
Look here.

39:36.350 --> 39:38.510
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

39:38.610 --> 39:42.530
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

39:42.710 --> 39:44.650
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

39:44.750 --> 39:49.670
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:01.770 --> 40:03.180
♪I've seen the mountains♪

40:03.380 --> 40:04.790
♪And trodden through ice♪

40:05.060 --> 40:07.870
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

40:08.180 --> 40:09.570
♪Destiny is my creed♪

40:09.630 --> 40:11.030
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

40:11.180 --> 40:12.970
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

40:14.180 --> 40:15.650
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

40:15.810 --> 40:17.100
♪Gazing through the mire♪

40:17.280 --> 40:19.670
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

40:19.870 --> 40:21.920
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

40:23.050 --> 40:24.890
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

40:26.840 --> 40:29.760
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

40:29.850 --> 40:32.510
♪There must always be a longing♪

40:32.970 --> 40:38.030
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

40:38.360 --> 40:40.370
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:40.690 --> 40:44.330
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:44.570 --> 40:46.460
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:46.490 --> 40:50.340
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:50.690 --> 40:52.630
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

40:52.810 --> 40:56.640
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

40:56.890 --> 41:02.650
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

41:03.530 --> 41:09.000
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

